    <string name="help">Help</string>
    <string name="help_status">AODLed needs all of these turned on to work. Tap any that\'s off to fix it.</string>
    <string name="help_filter"><b>All:</b> every app turns the light on. Silent and ongoing notifications, like music, downloads or navigation, never do.\n\n<b>Allow list:</b> only the apps you check turn it on. New apps stay off until you check them.\n\n<b>Ignore list:</b> every app turns it on except the ones you check.\n\nApps from Private Space or a work profile appear in the list after their first notification.\n\nThe test notification always turns the light on.</string>
    <string name="help_light_off"><b>When dismissed:</b> the light stays on until you clear the notification.\n\n<b>On unlock:</b> the light goes off as soon as you unlock the phone, even if the notification is still there. It comes back with the next new notification.</string>
    <string name="help_respect_dnd"><b>Respect:</b> only notifications that Do Not Disturb lets through turn the light on.\n\n<b>Ignore:</b> the light also comes on for notifications Do Not Disturb silences.\n\nThe test notification always turns it on.</string>
